1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 23=

2
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,000
Miss Xiaobai.

3
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,200
Where is Sizhou?

4
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,680
Sizhou...

5
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,240
He...

6
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,440
You can't go.

7
00:01:59,360 --> 00:01:59,800
Sizhou...

8
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,320
Sizhou is dead.

9
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,680
No, he isn't!

10
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,720
He didn't want you to go over.

11
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,760
Sizhou!

12
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,840
Sizhou...

13
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:08,810
Sizhou is dead!

14
00:02:08,810 --> 00:02:09,960
Where is Sizhou?

15
00:02:11,750 --> 00:02:12,720
Sizhou...

16
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,640
Sizhou is dead.

17
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:31,480
- Kill!
- Kill!

18
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,880
- Kill!
- Kill!

19
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:52,960
Why?

20
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,880
Why are you so good to everyone else?

21
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:01,120
Why leave me all alone in this world?

22
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:05,760
Why didn't I even get
to see you one last time?

23
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,520
If it weren't for me

24
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,240
holding him back,

25
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,120
maybe Sizhou

26
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,840
could have run away with you.

27
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:27,480
How did Sizhou die?

28
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:32,040
I only found out just now.

29
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,080
All of this

30
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,280
was Jingshu's trap.

31
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,640
She enticed me to kill Sizhou,

32
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,280
but her ultimate goal

33
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,640
was to wipe us out in one go,

34
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:53,480
so she could inherit the throne.

35
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:58,120
Jingshu killed Sizhou?

36
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,160
Yes.

37
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,160
I let Sizhou down.

38
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,240
I wanted to kill Sizhou,

39
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:18,960
yet he saved me.

40
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:22,440
So I must get

41
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:25,200
revenge.

42
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:34,560
Jingshu is Sizhou's birth mother,

43
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,960
but not mine.

44
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,360
Hetao, whom you found
at Xichun Pavilion,

45
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,880
was her dearest sister

46
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,000
twenty years ago.

47
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,960
It was Hetao who helped her

48
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,920
escape from Xichun Pavilion.

49
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,760
She came to Bojue Kingdom

50
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,760
all by herself

51
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,200
and fortunately won Father's favor.

52
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,200
But 15 years ago,

53
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:07,560
she ordered Ma Shuan from
the Imperial Kitchen to poison

54
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,640
and kill my birth mother,

55
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:14,640
Empress Yanshu.

56
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,920
She used that opportunity
to rise to power.

57
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,560
But looking at it now,

58
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:26,160
she isn't satisfied with just this.

59
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:34,240
What did Sizhou say before he died?

60
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,480
He said

61
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:44,160
he didn't want you to avenge him.

62
00:05:45,760 --> 00:05:47,960
He didn't want you
involved in this trouble anymore.

63
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,360
He wanted you

64
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,760
to live well.

65
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,560
Your Highness,

66
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:08,560
Second Prince Songpiao
and his death squad,

67
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:10,040
along with Hetao and Jiang Xiaobai,

68
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,160
have all been captured.

69
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,920
Behead

70
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,360
all Songpiao's accomplices.

71
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,160
Also,

72
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:18,160
have Hetao come see me.

73
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:18,800
Yes, Your Highness.

74
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:29,240
It's been over 20 years

75
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,160
since we parted
at Xichun Pavilion, right?

76
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,760
Back then,

77
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,440
if you hadn't started that fire,

78
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:56,960
I'd probably still be
at Xichun Pavilion,

79
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,360
pouring drinks and smiling for men,

80
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:00,440
tossed from one man's arms

81
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:02,520
into another's.

82
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,760
Yes.

83
00:07:06,400 --> 00:07:07,440
All these years,

84
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,760
I've always worried

85
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,520
about whether you
ran into trouble again.

86
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,200
All these years,

87
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:16,560
I really have owed you.

88
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,400
I didn't even think to send anyone

89
00:07:18,520 --> 00:07:19,840
to bring you a letter,

90
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,760
which would cause you to worry.

91
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,120
However,

92
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,760
you should be able to understand, right?

93
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,560
For women like us,

94
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,160
if we take one wrong step,

95
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,640
people will point at our backs

96
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:35,760
and curse us for the rest of our lives.

97
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,920
To get where I am today,

98
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,640
there are many things

99
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,760
I had to hide,

100
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,360
not daring to let anyone find even

101
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,240
the slightest trace.

102
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,720
But ultimately,

103
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:50,000
these matters

104
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,040
have always weighed on my mind.

105
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,920
For my whole life,

106
00:07:54,520 --> 00:07:56,040
I've had to be so careful

107
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,560
and terrified.

108
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,760
Now,

109
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,320
the higher I climb,

110
00:08:01,960 --> 00:08:03,520
the heavier this weight hanging over me

111
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:04,800
becomes.

112
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,320
I realized

113
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,960
that this is no long-term solution.

114
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,160
Hetao,

115
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,640
your affection for me

116
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,720
is deeply hidden in my heart.

117
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,440
But the only thing I can do now

118
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:33,040
is to let you keep your dignity.

119
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:51,720
I'm not running!

120
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:53,800
I'm not trying to run away!

121
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,320
Putao,

122
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,960
please spare me!

123
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:04,520
Aren't we best sisters?

124
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:09,640
Have you forgotten
that back at Xichun Pavilion,

125
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,440
you always took care of me?

126
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:17,000
How can you treat me like this now?

127
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,040
I swear I'll never tell anyone!

128
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:24,320
If I tell anyone,

129
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,600
may lightning strike me dead!

130
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:31,160
A person's mouth

131
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:34,760
is the most
unreliable thing in this world.

132
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,240
Putao!

133
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:38,080
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

134
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:41,440
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

135
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,840
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

136
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:46,760
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

137
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,640
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

138
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:55,320
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

139
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,480
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

140
00:11:57,640 --> 00:12:00,960
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

141
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:06,600
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

142
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:10,200
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

143
00:12:10,640 --> 00:12:13,240
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

144
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:17,280
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

145
00:12:17,520 --> 00:12:20,560
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

146
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:23,640
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

147
00:12:23,640 --> 00:12:26,360
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

148
00:12:26,640 --> 00:12:29,600
♪I'll only say that once♪

149
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,840
♪I called your name♪

150
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:38,680
♪The silent stars hang low♪

151
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:42,280
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

152
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:45,440
♪I linger in the old tower♪

153
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:49,200
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

154
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:52,960
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

155
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:56,640
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

156
00:12:57,400 --> 00:12:59,640
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

157
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:05,880
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

158
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:09,040
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

159
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:13,120
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

160
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,760
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

161
00:13:15,760 --> 00:13:20,040
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

162
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:22,960
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

163
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:26,120
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

164
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:28,800
♪If we meet again in another life♪

165
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:31,840
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

166
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,800
♪Was when we first met?♪

167
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,480
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

168
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,360
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
